visualGrammar:
VISUAL PRIORITY (most specific first): archival_photo > news_footage > youtube_clip > motion_graphic > document_screenshot > social_post > map > text_card > stock_broll > ai_illustration.
Real material of the named person, place or event always beats a generic image. Stock B-roll only for concrete nouns (English query), never for a named person. Never request an AI image of a real person, a real logo or a real document.
One beat = one visual idea: 1–3 s in the hook, 1.5–6.5 s in the body (~3.2 s). Do not hold the same visual for 4+ beats in a row; change asset or framing instead.
Motion graphics carry numbers, dates, documents, posts and comparisons. Fill motion_data_json ONLY from fact-sheet values and ids. Fact refs are mandatory: quote_card, tweet_card, comment_pile → quote_id (text/body = the verbatim quote); headline_stack → source_id per item; document_highlight → source_id (+ quote_id for the highlighted passage); counter, money_counter, bar_chart, line_chart → figure_id (+ source_id for charts); timeline → event_id per event; evidence_board → source_id or person_id per item. A beat whose refs fail validation is downgraded to kinetic_text + a reconstruction label.
Cue tags drive components: PERSON_INTRO → lower third / freeze label (first mention only); QUOTE → quote card; TWEET → post card; REVEAL → stamp (≤ 1 per chapter); SHOCK → keyword slam (≤ 1 per chapter); NUMBER → counter; TIME_JUMP → date stamp; COMPARISON → split screen; SENSITIVE → censor bar / bleep; DOCUMENT and EMPHASIS → spotlight; LIST → kinetic text, photo burst or evidence board; MONTAGE → photo burst; CLIP_REF → source label. EMPHASIS on at most 1 beat in 3.
on_screen_text: names, numbers, dates and 1–4 key words only — never the narration. emphasis_words: the 1–3 words a viewer must catch.
Music mood changes only at act or tone shifts; mark the biggest reveal of a chapter so the music can drop before it.
motion_data_json formats (template (component): example):
- kinetic_text (KineticText): {"lines":["THREE LAWSUITS","IN ONE WEEK"],"emphasis":["THREE"]}
- counter (NumberCounter): {"figure_id":"N4","value":1200000,"from":0,"label":"customers","unit":"","decimals":0,"format":"compact"}
- money_counter (NumberCounter): {"figure_id":"N2","value":4000000000,"from":0,"currency":"USD","label":"valuation","compact":true}
- timeline (TimelineGraphic): {"events":[{"date":"2019-05","label":"App launch","event_id":"E1"},{"date":"2021-03","label":"$600M round","event_id":"E4"},{"date":"2023-01","label":"Bankruptcy filing","event_id":"E9"}],"active_index":2}
- bar_chart (BarChart): {"title":"Yearly revenue","unit":"$M","source_id":"S3","bars":[{"label":"2021","value":120,"figure_id":"N5","highlight":false},{"label":"2022","value":12,"figure_id":"N6","highlight":true}]}
- line_chart (BarChart): {"title":"Active users","unit":"M","source_id":"S3","bars":[{"label":"2021","value":3.1,"figure_id":"N7","highlight":false},{"label":"2022","value":0.4,"figure_id":"N8","highlight":true}]}
- map_route (MapPin): {"places":[{"label":"Lisbon","lon":-9.14,"lat":38.72},{"label":"Dubai","lon":55.27,"lat":25.2}],"route":true,"region":"auto"}
- quote_card (QuoteCard): {"quote_id":"Q3","text":"<the verbatim quote from the fact sheet>","speaker":"<speaker name>","source":"<outlet, court or platform>","date":"2022-06-01"}
- tweet_card (SocialPost): {"quote_id":"Q5","display_name":"<account display name>","handle":"@handle","body":"<the verbatim post>","date":"2022-11-08","likes":null,"reposts":null,"replies":null,"variant":"post"}
- headline_stack (HeadlineStack): {"items":[{"source_id":"S2","outlet":"<outlet>","headline":"<headline exactly as published>","date":"2022-11-11"}]}
- document_highlight (DocumentCard; kind "article" → ArticleHighlight): {"source_id":"S7","quote_id":"Q9","kind":"court","outlet":"","title":"<document title>","date":"2022-12-13","paragraphs":["<verbatim paragraph from the source>"],"highlight":"<exact phrase inside a paragraph>","redact":[]}
- split_compare (SplitScreen): {"left_label":"2019","right_label":"2023","left_query":"<what to show on the left>","right_query":"<what to show on the right>"}
- org_chart (KineticText): {"nodes":[{"label":"<founder name>","role":"CEO"},{"label":"<company>","role":"holding"}]}
- photo_burst (PhotoBurst): {"count":5,"caption":""}
- evidence_board (EvidenceBoard): {"items":[{"label":"The loan","person_id":"","source_id":"S4"},{"label":"The audit","person_id":"P2","source_id":"S9"}],"links":[[0,1]]}
- comment_pile (CommentPile): {"items":[{"quote_id":"Q11"},{"quote_id":"Q12"},{"quote_id":"Q13"}]}
